### Particle POC manual requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:8100
@practiceId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@elevaidId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register the Particle sandbox test patient (from the Prod-Sandbox Signal collection)
POST {{base}}/particle-records/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "practiceId": "{{practiceId}}",
  "elevaidId": "{{elevaidId}}",
  "firstName": "Elvira",
  "lastName": "Valadez-Nucleus",
  "dob": "1970-12-26",
  "genderAtBirth": "F",
  "address": { "city": "Boston", "state": "MA", "zip": "02215" },
  "subscribeMonitoring": true,
  "requestedBy": "dr-test"
}

### Physician "Sync"
POST {{base}}/particle-records/pull
Content-Type: application/json

{ "practiceId": "{{practiceId}}", "elevaidId": "{{elevaidId}}", "requestedBy": "dr-test" }

### Status (no clinical data)
GET {{base}}/particle-records/practices/{{practiceId}}/patients/{{elevaidId}}/status

### Parsed data (PHI)
GET {{base}}/particle-records/practices/{{practiceId}}/patients/{{elevaidId}}/parsed

### Signal events received
GET {{base}}/particle-records/practices/{{practiceId}}/patients/{{elevaidId}}/signal-events

### Sandbox: fire a simulated admit alert at our webhook (needs a public HTTPS tunnel)
POST {{base}}/particle-records/sandbox/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "practiceId": "{{practiceId}}",
  "elevaidId": "{{elevaidId}}",
  "workflow": "ADMIT_TRANSITION_ALERT",
  "callbackUrl": "https://YOUR-TUNNEL.example.com/particle-records/webhook"
}

### Parser-only: ingest a Flat payload you already have (paste flat_data.json contents into "flat")
POST {{base}}/particle-records/ingest-flat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "practiceId": "{{practiceId}}", "elevaidId": "{{elevaidId}}", "flat": { "problems": [] } }
